      "en": "Drink Level mechanic: Jamie starts every round at Drink Level 0. He gains levels with The Devil Inside (22P; hold P to take up to 4 drinks at once, but it gets slower) or by ending combos with drink enders such as 2HK > HK > P (Phantom Sway + Drink) or the third hit of Freeflow Kicks (236P > 6K > 6K). Each level raises his damage (0 = 90%, 1 = 95%, 2 = 100%, 3 = 105%, 4 = 110%) and unlocks moves: level 1 = Bitter Strikes (5LP > LK > MP) and Luminous Dive Kick; level 2 = Full Moon Kick and Bakkai; level 3 = Intoxicated Assault and Tenshin (command grab); level 4 = Ransui Haze, Swagger Hermit Punch and stronger Freeflow Strikes. Drinking also refills Drive Gauge. Levels reset after every KO, and SA2 (The Devil's Song) gives temporary level 4 access. Gameplan: early in the round, play patient footsies with 2MK, 5MK and 2MP, punish mistakes, and turn every knockdown into a safe drink or a combo that ends in a drink. As his level rises, push forward with Drive Rush, frame traps (5MP is +2) and, from level 3, Tenshin to break blocking opponents. On defense, use 2HP or Arrow Kick as anti-air and OD Arrow Kick (fully invincible frames 1-9) as a reversal.",
